<title>POLAND: KOMUNALNY JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KOMUNALNY JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.47 vs    0.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.75 vs    1.05</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  1.69 vs    2.13</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 3.67 vs    3.70</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.65 vs    3.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    5.75 vs    5.20</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  9.97 vs    7.10</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	21.98 vs   16.02</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Komunalny SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
